Z||000000||Loki||12-30-2001||08:44 PM||||OK ehers the deal, as some of you  me and my ex aplit with her keeping my son Luke. We have not gone to court at all yet and it was decided I would send $300 a month. For the most part i have, unless I didnt have it of course. About 2 months ago me and the ex had made plans for me to goto Wyoming from Texas for a week so I can be with my son (which I havnt seen in 8 months) all in all it goes well, then the day I buy my plane ticket ($800 NON refundable) I get an e-mail form her (she wont talk to me directly) stating I will get NO visitation with my son till we goto court. That much didnt bother me TO bad (sarcasim) since I know knew what what have to be done.<BR>  She has been out of town for a few weeks and I havnt seen any money in a few weeks due to, well losing the money on the tickets and not having any. And dont take this the wrong way, I would send my son everything I had if I could.  So tonight I call to speak with my son, which I try to do once a week so he can hear his fathers voice and hear me telling him I love him (even though he doesnt understand) So she gets on the phone and the first thing she ask'd is " Where is my damn money?" Stating I have a responsibility to send CS (Which i know I do, just havnt had, get where im going?) So I state she has a right to allow me to see my son it works both ways, yadda yadda. I have my talk with my son and then she demands money and states I get no visitaion and hangs up. So I call back and ask her mom to relay a msg since the  :ex" wont talk. Which her mom starts yelling at me stating im yelling, which of course my roommate never heard me yelling, just asking in a calm mannor. So she bitched about the money and stated that next time my son is hungry or whatever that they will tell him "im sorry but daddy said he will send it whenever and he is a bad operson and doesnt love him??!?!?!?!?!?!?!?!?!?!?!?!?!!?!?  WHAT THE HELL!!!! And no not recorded so that doesnt help. She then goers to say that me thinking im beiong kepped from my son is just in my head and I can belive if I want. Which I do, I mean come om!!!!  So anywho, ill get my lawyer.. Im going for joint custody, since im better and want him to be with both parents, but I will fight for him to live with me cause I think she is mentally unstable and well she live with her parents and from her mouth she was abused mentally and physically by her mom..Bad combination I think...So anyway, anyone have ANY kind of advice????  Im working on the lawyer now..<P>And sorry bout the bad grammer..I broke my hand...<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fieroloki.com/lokisig1%20copy.jpg">   <BR>"All Fieros broke right now" :(||||reg||1
